  <h2 id="spinj">Injury prevention and recovery basics</h2>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table paths-table--wide">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Habit</th>
          <th>Why</th>
          <th>Check</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Habit"><strong>Warm up and cool down</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Why">Prepares muscles and joints</td>
          <td data-label="Check">Never skip it before matches</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Habit"><strong>Gradual increase in workload</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Why">Overuse is a common cause of injury</td>
          <td data-label="Check">Raise load slowly</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Habit"><strong>Sleep and nutrition</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Why">Recovery depends on them</td>
          <td data-label="Check">Track sleep hours</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Habit"><strong>Report pain early</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Why">Small problems grow</td>
          <td data-label="Check">Tell the coach at once</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Habit"><strong>Medical check when needed</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Why">Get proper advice</td>
          <td data-label="Check">See a qualified doctor or physiotherapist</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    A serious injury can end a playing career, so prevention is part of training, not an extra.
  </p>

  <h2 id="spacad">Questions to ask before joining an academy</h2>

