  <h2 id="spmind">Handling pressure, failure and selection setbacks</h2>

  <p>
    Almost every serious player faces being dropped, injured or overlooked. Players who build routines for these moments recover faster and stay in the game or move on with clarity.
  </p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table paths-table--wide">
      <thead>
